{
	"version": 1,
	"project": "example-project",
	"cwd": "/absolute/path/to/project",
	"notes": [
		"Illustrative caller-maintained sibling bookmarks, not a runtime standard. All identities below are fictional.",
		"Copy this file to team.json at the repository root and ignore /team.json in that repository's .gitignore.",
		"Everyone is a sibling, including the coordinator. Tasks are agreed with the human for each piece of work, not fixed identities.",
		"The role field is only a descriptive form of address: coordinating sibling or sibling. It assigns no task, standing duty or permission.",
		"A garden ID marks a sibling's birth and remains its delivery address across supported same-ID returns. The native session ID identifies that harness's conversation.",
		"The top-level cwd is shared by the members shown in this single-project example; consult each citizen's record for its actual cwd.",
		"Read both IDs, backend and cwd from Entwurf's current record facts. This bookmark does not replace the record or certify current liveness. If they disagree, the record wins; reconcile the bookmark, never rewrite the record to match it.",
		"Keep entries after retirement. Membership is not permission to send, resume or retire; use explicit operator requests and the owning lifecycle tools.",
		"No program loads this example as configuration. It owns no authentication, transcript, model, placement, role assignment or lifecycle automation."
	],
	"members": [
		{
			"name": "Coordinator",
			"role": "coordinating sibling",
			"backend": "pi-durable",
			"garden_id": "20260101T090000-a1b2c3",
